 "notes": "Georgia's DOR plate gallery (mvd.dor.ga.gov/motor/plates/PlateSelection.aspx) could not be fetched, so robot_url is null and no retirements could be checked. HB 208 (2025) also authorized Shepherd Center, Southern University Alumni, Alabama State University and a new Delta Sigma Theta plate, but these need prepaid applications and I found no sign they've been issued. Calling Selfless Service the Veterans Service Foundation plate is my inference. The America 250 plate (Jan 2026–2030) is a free standard-plate option, not a specialty plate, so it's left out. Image URLs are from GA DNR, the sponsoring state agency."
